'' ...AND A LINK WHOSE EXE IS GONE IS MADE (tiko-build B5): the same warm build after the output
'' directory was emptied links again. The exe's record outlives it, in the module cache, but
'' names the exe as that link left it, so it cannot match.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.blrc/cache
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.blrc
'' CLEAN: build/.blr
'' COPY: tests/driver/src/unitcache => build/.blrs
'' STEP: build -target windows-x86_64 build/.blrs/a.tiko build/.blrs/b.tiko -o build/.blr/app.exe
'' STEP: build -target windows-x86_64 build/.blrs/a.tiko build/.blrs/b.tiko -o build/.blr/app.exe
'' CLEAN: build/.blr
'' ARGS: build -target windows-x86_64 build/.blrs/a.tiko build/.blrs/b.tiko -o build/.blr/app.exe -v
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: is up to date
'' RUN: build/.blr/app.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: b says 7
